l":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74502ffee6b2f564\" href=\"?note=74502ffee6b2f564\" title=\"43-df-lowforomega\">43-df-lowforomega</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20e3dbe19bf74740\" href=\"?note=20e3dbe19bf74740\" title=\"43-df-weakly-lowfork\">43-df-weakly-lowfork</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForOmega}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{WeaklyLowForK}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForOmega}(A)\\iff\\mathrm{WeaklyLowForK}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补足弱低性的核心等价；注意此处不是对全部有限串控制 K。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lowforomega","status":"resolved","id":"74502ffee6b2f564","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforomega]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weakly-lowfork","status":"resolved","id":"20e3dbe19bf74740","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-weakly-lowfork]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforomega","status":"resolved","id":"74502ffee6b2f564","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-lowforomega]]、[[43-df-weakly-lowfork]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weakly-lowfork","status":"resolved","id":"20e3dbe19bf74740","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-lowforomega]]、[[43-df-weakly-lowfork]]。","embe